    // acts + tile-scratch + dW-split + non-GEMM-partial of the old wgmma Fork-B).
    // Layout order MUST match the kernel's pointer derivations:
    //   [nCTA*total | loss(nCTA) | loss_out(1) | opt_reduce(2nCTA+1) |
